Package: manifoldtest.simulations
Type: Package
Title: Simulations for "Independence Test on Riemannian Manifolds"
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mingyu", "Li", role = "aut"),
    person("Javier", "González-Delgado", email = "javiergonde@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Code that produces the numerical experiments of Liu, Li,
    González-Delgado and Hallin (2026), "Independence test on Riemannian
    manifolds". The tests proposed in the paper are run with the package
    'manifoldtest'; this package adds the benchmark procedures (Raw-dCov,
    Geo-dCov, BallCov and HHG) and one script per figure and per number
    quoted in the text, installed in the 'scripts' directory.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/gonzalez-delgado/manifoldtest-simulations
BugReports: https://github.com/gonzalez-delgado/manifoldtest-simulations/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0),
    manifoldtest (>= 1.0.0),
    energy
Imports:
    Ball,
    data.table,
    ggplot2,
    parallel,
    reshape2,
    stats,
    utils
Remotes:
    gonzalez-delgado/manifoldtest
SystemRequirements: Python 3 with numpy and pandas (HHG benchmark)
